# ── LaTeX build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything under output/ is regenerated by `make pdf`, with one exception:
# the compiled book is committed so readers can download it without a build.
latex-pipeline/output/*
!latex-pipeline/output/agentico-por-diseno.pdf

# Figures compiled from tikz/svg sources (see docs/figuras.md)
ingenieria_agentica/figuras/pdf/
latex-pipeline/illustrations/*.pdf
latex-pipeline/illustrations/.cache/

